### Feature Sale - UPDATE (PUT) / UPDATE (PATCH) (público, sin token)
### Sustituye @id por una venta destinada a pruebas.
### El DTO actualiza la cabecera; las líneas se administran en ProductSale.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002
@id = REPLACE_WITH_TEST_ID

# @name updateSalePut
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/ventas/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_id": 1,
  "tax": 20,
  "discounts": 10,
  "sale_date": "2026-10-08T12:00:00.000Z"
}

###

# @name updateSalePatch
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/ventas/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tax": 15,
  "discounts": 0
}
